---
description: Native Studium colors and HTML must stay aligned with studium-web theme
globs: Studium/**/*.swift, Studium/Assets.xcassets/**/*.colorset/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- **Source of truth:** Web tokens live in `studium-web/src/index.css` (`:root` dark, `.light`). Native UI uses the same hex values via **Asset Catalog** colorsets: `StudiumBg`, `StudiumCard`, `StudiumSurface`, `StudiumFillTertiary`, `StudiumBorder`, plus `AccentColor` (`#007AFF`).
- **Swift mapping:** `PlatformColors.swift` — `systemGroupedBackground` → `StudiumBg`, `systemBackground` → `StudiumCard`, `secondarySystemGroupedBackground` → `StudiumSurface`, `tertiarySystemGroupedBackground` → `StudiumSurface`, `tertiarySystemFill` → `StudiumFillTertiary`. Chip outlines use `Color.studiumBorder`.
- **Quiz / reference HTML:** `buildHTMLString` / `StudiumHTMLBuilder` use SF Pro in HTML CSS; palette matches web. WKWebView loads with `StudiumHTMLBuilder.contentBaseURL` (CDN).
- **Typography:** Native chrome uses system (SF Pro) via `StudiumDesignSystem`. Monospaced only for stats digits, question IDs, and optional vocab roots.
